Subject: [PATCH] Disable marquee in One UI 9 Compose quick tile labels

The One UI 9 panel uses Compose for both normal and tile-box labels. Preserve
the incoming layout and semantics modifiers without appending an animated
marquee, and use end ellipsis for each title and subtitle. Clear the Text
overflow default bit so Compose does not replace Ellipsis with Clip.
Other media, detail and header marquees retain their stock behavior.

